### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000/api
@authToken = your_auth_token_here
@tenantId = 1

### ============================================================================
### 1. RESOLUÇÃO DE TENANT & ROTAS DE CONTEXTO
### ============================================================================

### 1.1 Testar Endpoint de Resolução de Tenant via Header X-Tenant-ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/test-tenant-endpoint
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.2 Testar Endpoint com Parâmetro de URL de Tenant
GET {{baseUrl}}/tenant/{{tenantId}}/data
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.3 Consultar Recursos com Tenant Ativo (Exemplo: Wallets)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallets
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.4 Consultar Clientes do Tenant Ativo
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
X-Tenant-ID: {{tenantId}}
Accept: application/json
